    <artifactId>healthcore-pack-hie</artifactId>
    <name>Opes HealthCore Capability Pack 08 — Regional &amp; National Health Information Exchange (HIE)</name>
    <description>
        Standalone regional/national HIE capability pack: Master Patient Index (MPI), Terminology,
        FHIR R4 / HL7 v2 / IHE XDS.b/PIX/PDQ exchange, Integration Operations &amp; DLQ replay, and
        API Product governance. Strictly isolated: ZERO inpatient, billing, pharmacy, or pharma manufacturing dependencies.
    </description>
